<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico places first two credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico places first two credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has placed the first two of four credits whereby it sought to inject 5.933 billion pesos in the secondary market on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered or assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    1.644 bln  17 days   32.67 pct</p>
<p>    1.644 bln  11 days   32.56 pct</p>
<p>    1.645 bln   8 days</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   3 days</p>
<p>    *Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
